{
    "test_name": "MOB.341_Work_Map_Toggle",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.341_Work_Map_Toggle",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.341` The work list's map-view toggle (T2.1).\n- **SELF-RESTORING, and it has to be.** `mapView` is `useSessionStorage`\n  (`show-mobile-work-map`), and Datadog reuses ONE browser session across a whole suite \u2014 so a\n  run that ended in map view would leave every later work-order subtest looking at a\n  map instead of a list. The restore leg is `alwaysExecute` (trap 16c).\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **The toggle is a silent no-op until the list finishes loading** \u2014\n  `onClick={() => loadedAll ? setMapView(!mapView) : undefined}`. Clicking early\n  reports a successful click and changes nothing, so this test uses the shared\n  `work_list_gate()`, whose three `assertPageLacks` checks are how `loadedAll` is\n  inferred (there is no positive flag in the DOM).\n- **The proof is sessionStorage, not the icon** (trap 16): the state is persisted, so\n  the stored value is the source of truth and the icon is only a rendering of it.\n- Gated on `permissions.map.read`, so this runs as `Admin`.\n- Icon names were **measured** (trap 14): `faGlobe` \u2192 `globe`, `faList` \u2192 `list`.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **Asserts nothing about work ROWS, deliberately.** The `Admin` crew's work list is\n  empty (measured \u2014 `MOB.978_DIAG_WorkList_Probe`), so a row-count check would be\n  vacuously true (trap 5). The list-vs-map discriminator is the Virtuoso scroller and\n  the Mapbox canvas, both of which hold regardless of how much data there is.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Work Order",
            "Map",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
            "device_ids": [
                "chrome.tablet"
            ],
            "disable_cors": false,
            "disable_csp": false,
            "ignore_server_certificate_error": false,
            "min_failure_duration": 0,
            "min_location_failed": 1,
            "monitor_options": {},
            "no_screenshot": false,
            "retry": {
                "count": 1,
                "interval": 300.0
            },
            "rum_settings": {
                "is_enabled": false
            },
            "tick_every": 86400
        },
        "steps": [
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Navigate to /work \u2014 the work order list",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/work"
                },
                "type": "goToUrl"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let the work list begin rendering",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 3
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "The \"Work Orders\" page mounted",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "check": "contains",
                    "value": "Work Orders",
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/work",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//*[@id=\"page-title\"]//h4[contains(normalize-space(.), \"Work Orders\")]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementContent",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Wait for the workstage pages and the lookup prefetch",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 20
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "The work list rendered its search box",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/work",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//input[@placeholder=\"Find Workstage(s)\"]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementPresent"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "LOADEDALL 1/3: the initial fetch finished",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "Retrieving assigned work"
                },
                "type": "assertPageLacks"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "LOADEDALL 2/3: paging through workstages finished",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "workstages found"
                },
                "type": "assertPageLacks"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "LOADEDALL 3/3: the per-stage detail downloads finished",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "workstages downloaded"
                },
                "type": "assertPageLacks"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "BASELINE: the list is NOT in map view",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return sessionStorage.getItem('show-mobile-work-map') === null || sessionStorage.getItem('show-mobile-work-map') === 'false';"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "BASELINE: the list container is showing and no map canvas exists yet",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "const list = document.querySelector('[data-virtuoso-scroller], [data-testid*=\"virtuoso\"]');\nreturn !!list && !document.querySelector('canvas.mapboxgl-canvas');"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "The map toggle is present (permissions.map.read)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/work",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//button[.//*[@data-icon=\"globe\" or contains(concat(\" \", normalize-space(@class), \" \"), \" fa-globe \") or @data-icon=\"earth-americas\" or contains(concat(\" \", normalize-space(@class), \" \"), \" fa-earth-americas \")]]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementPresent",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Switch the work list to map view",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/work",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//button[.//*[@data-icon=\"globe\" or contains(concat(\" \", normalize-space(@class), \" \"), \" fa-globe \") or @data-icon=\"earth-americas\" or contains(concat(\" \", normalize-space(@class), \" \"), \" fa-earth-americas \")]]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "click",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let Mapbox initialise",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 6
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "PROOF: sessionStorage['show-mobile-work-map'] is now 'true'",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return sessionStorage.getItem('show-mobile-work-map') === 'true';"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "PROOF: the Mapbox WebGL canvas rendered on /work",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/work",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//canvas[contains(@class,\"mapboxgl-canvas\")]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementPresent",
                "timeout": 60
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "PROOF: the LIST container is gone \u2014 the map replaced it, it did not stack",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return !document.querySelector('[data-virtuoso-scroller], [data-testid*=\"virtuoso\"]');"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": true,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Switch back to the list view (restore)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/work",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//button[.//*[@data-icon=\"list\" or contains(concat(\" \", normalize-space(@class), \" \"), \" fa-list \") or @data-icon=\"list-ul\" or contains(concat(\" \", normalize-space(@class), \" \"), \" fa-list-ul \")]]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "click",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": true,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let the list re-render",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 4
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": true,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "RESTORED: sessionStorage['show-mobile-work-map'] is back to 'false'",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return sessionStorage.getItem('show-mobile-work-map') === 'false';"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": true,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "RESTORED: the list container is back and the map canvas is gone",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "const list = document.querySelector('[data-virtuoso-scroller], [data-testid*=\"virtuoso\"]');\nconst canvas = document.querySelector('canvas.mapboxgl-canvas');\nreturn !!list && !canvas;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 60
            }
        ]
    }
}